      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -330
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 · FINISH\nRuns the **open-source finishing engine** (`scripts/finish.py` + `audio.py`):\n\n- beat-synced cut from `config/edl.json` (90 BPM, 1 beat = 20 frames)\n- speed ramps, whip-blur / zoom-punch transitions, impact flashes, crystal-shard wipes\n- auto star-glints locked to the brightest real highlights, light sweeps\n- unified emerald grade, bloom, anamorphic streaks, grain\n- kinetic title lock-up (ŠKODA / SUPERB)\n- synthesised score + whooshes + impacts cut to the same beat grid\n\nSet `preview: true` for a fast half-res draft.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 330,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2b5133b0-a273-5bf4-8abc-14f2fd0c6ef5",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "1049d91e-efe0-51d8-a2b8-32e3dd5f2770",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ✏️  EDIT ME — the only place where paths and the API address live.\nreturn [{ json: {\n  // Real Google API. For a free rehearsal against the bundled mock server use:\n  //   http://host.docker.internal:8099/v1beta      (n8n in Docker)   or   http://127.0.0.1:8099/v1beta   (n8n on the host)\n  api_base: 'https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta',\n  data_dir: '/data',          // folder that contains inputs/, config/, stills/, clips/, scripts/, out/\n  preview: true,              // true = quick 540×960 draft, false = final 1080×1920\n  output_name: 'SKODA_SUPERB_CRYSTAL_CAVE_V02',\n  workers: 4,\n}}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "12d0de32-deb4-5127-8892-0a8c1947177c",
      "name": "Check clips",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "executeOnce": true,
        "command": "=python3 {{ $json.data_dir }}/scripts/finish.py --check --edl {{ $json.data_dir }}/config/edl.json --clips {{ $json.data_dir }}/clips"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9960adb7-c2c9-569e-a6e6-c47b6cd44ca3",
      "name": "Score (audio.py)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "executeOnce": true,
        "command": "=mkdir -p {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/audio && python3 {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/scripts/audio.py --edl {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/config/edl.json --out {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/audio/score.wav"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "31ed1a12-9d2b-592b-9200-64baa9bb8907",
      "name": "Render (finish.py)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "executeOnce": true,
        "command": "=mkdir -p {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/out && python3 {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/scripts/finish.py --edl {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/config/edl.json --clips {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/clips --audio {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/audio/score.wav --out {{ $('Config').first().json.data_dir }}/out/{{ $('Config').first().json.output_name }}{{ $('Config').first().json.preview ? '_PREVIEW' : '' }}.mp4 --scale {{ $('Config').first().json.preview ? 0.5 : 1.0 }} --workers {{ $('Config').first().json.workers }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4e8054e1-3fcc-5040-aba5-6d6c41e988af",
      "name": "Probe output",
